commit 69e7b892b0d14eea2f41af5a09201d0ca5ee7352
Author: Stibbons' Igor <igor@stibbons.email>
Date:   Sat Nov 7 13:26:08 2026 +0100

    fix: harden cancel settle, report entry and Judge/Optimizer reasons (#41)
    
    - Close waits 5 s for cancelled Runs; the timeout warning names the Runs
      (runIds) and drops them, so a later close/settled returns at once.
    - runReport(storage, runId) is the one report entry point: it reads the
      Mastra snapshot itself and fails with RunSnapshotError naming the Run.
    - redactReason (api-key.ts): masked-key scrub and 2000-char cap shared by
      the OpenAI Image Model and every Judge/Optimizer reason.
    - optimizer-failed and judge-failed stops log a warning with the reason.
    - laneStopReason returns LaneStop; stopLane takes it, so a detail reason
      without its detail (or a stray detail) no longer type-checks.
    - stop_detail is schema-decoded; LaneResult carries stopDetail.
    - quoteOptimizerCall returns a CallEstimate; llmCaller drops
      S extends object; the Optimizer maps its Rejected answer explicitly.
    - Test: the RunStore keeps its permit until an interrupted attempt ends.

